title: Campfire Tale
portrait left: seeker
portrait right: scholar

scholar: Come, sit at my fire!
seeker: Have you seen others travel this road?
scholar: Yes, many in fact. Some showed me a book of cards-
scholar: -and called it their "tome".
seeker: I've got one of those.
scholar: So you have! Can't say I understand it...
scholar: But perhaps another could help?

> hp 10
> card add bookmark
> end
